---
title: "Zanzibar Attractions & Activities"
description: "Explore Zanzibar's UNESCO sites, marine parks, spice farms and adventure activities, all bookable through Spice and Sail Zanzibar."
permalink: "/attractions/index.html"
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="content">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>Attractions & Activities</h1>
    <p>Explore Zanzibar's UNESCO sites, marine parks, spice farms, and adventure activities. All attractions can be included in custom tour packages.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: #003853;">Featured Zanzibar Attractions & Marine Activities</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="filters-bar reveal">
        <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all">All Attractions</button>
        <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="Attraction">Attractions</button>
        <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="Dive Center">Dive Centers</button>
        <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="Water Sports">Water Sports</button>
      </div>
      <div class="cards-grid attraction-grid">
        {% for attraction in __attractionsDedup %}
          <article class="card attraction-card reveal" data-type="{{ attraction.category }}">
            <div class="card-image" style="position:relative;">
              {% set aImg = attraction.name | attractionImg(attraction.category) %}
              <img src="{{ aImg | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ aImg | canonicalAlt(attraction.name) }}" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <span class="card-badge badge-cultural">{{ attraction.type }}</span>
              <h3 class="card-title">{{ attraction.name }}</h3>
              <p class="card-meta">{{ attraction.zone }}, {{ attraction.island }}</p>
              <div class="card-footer">
                {% if attraction.website %}
                  <a href="{{ attraction.website }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Visit Website</a>
                {% else %}
                  <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934?text=Hi%20Spice%20and%20Sail%2C%20please%20send%20prices%20and%20a%20bookable%20slot%20for%20{{ attraction.name | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Book via WhatsApp</a>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
